{"title":"2025 SSMO Speed Round Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_SSMO_Speed_Round_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/4/784cefce4ebe9935de18945fc79c12dbdbad46a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$63a = 40b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" />. The sum of all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/a/22a4a58753bfe0a8831beb17bc44ddc5c1136ef3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{\\varphi(a)}{\\varphi(b)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"32\" height=\"29\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/8/8c80f7cbc6e8017ab735d473c6f3eb2e66a40511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{m}{n},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are relatively prime positive integers. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_SSMO_Speed_Round_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/5/8c5b6bab34e4e60febc6990eeb03f0d8cae66f22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2^{w+3}3^x5^{y+1}7^zT$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"154\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/8/b483523bbc27b7b928000c371be09fa6a8cdfd55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 2^w3^{x+2}5^y7^{z+1}T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"152\" height=\"17\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> are all nonnegative integers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is a positive integer not divisible by any of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Then,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/b/acb1edf82eb4276183221e1a44fdd76311fb91ab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\varphi(a)}{\\varphi(b)} = \\frac{\\varphi(2^{w+3})}{\\varphi(2^{w})} \\cdot \\frac{\\varphi(3^{x})}{\\varphi(3^{x+2})} \\cdot \\frac{\\varphi(5^{y+1})}{\\varphi(5^{y})} \\cdot \\frac{\\varphi(7^{z})}{\\varphi(7^{z+1})}.\\]\" width=\"363\" height=\"44\" />Now, we determine the possible values of each factor on the right hand side based on the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<ul><li>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/2/c525fe9916ff50c0b5823b3d2ba02f13c3cb9965.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w=0$\" width=\"46\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/7/9c790b92582f38504bf50efb516ed1bbb15c85a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{\\varphi(2^{w+3})}{\\varphi(2^{w})} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"88\" height=\"30\" />; if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/c/a6ce0e2162f852d8a458c8035ed5e4deb737279d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/d/9cdbef40df8789f55e7f3c7126057f30e94d59e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{\\varphi(2^{w+3})}{\\varphi(2^{w})} = \\tfrac{2^{w+2}\\varphi(2)}{2^{w-1}\\varphi(2)} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"173\" height=\"30\" />.</li>\n<li>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ea5b6f6de584d56d19a89cc4923a9d9a5cfa41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/9/2b9c83a62c5120e3d08cfc5a1d526f7dd0738231.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{\\varphi(3^{x})}{\\varphi(3^{x+2})} = \\tfrac{1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"88\" height=\"29\" />; if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e28efa00c4f2c66d1aa381c0cb1f8e0ef8d6e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/e/63e70964356256024f630f131ddcb73bedef32b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{\\varphi(3^{x})}{\\varphi(3^{x+2})} = \\tfrac{3^{x-1}\\varphi(3)}{3^{x+1}\\varphi(3)} = \\tfrac{1}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"171\" height=\"30\" />.</li>\n<li>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec89f09c84538ec43930ca5d8e5e0957e2000822.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/7/4e7bb227bbedebc91a951138a4e4148bf9372dc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{\\varphi(5^{y+1})}{\\varphi(5^{y})} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"86\" height=\"30\" />; if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/3/cf32406671fc9a01b1982019404e3f981a0f56b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/d/1fd6b59ba707be69834c5214969948b95bec6ff6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{\\varphi(5^{y+1})}{\\varphi(5^{y})} = \\tfrac{5^{y}\\varphi(5)}{5^{y-1}\\varphi(5)} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"169\" height=\"30\" />.</li>\n<li>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/72079803c6fcdcfa95b6d7f383f6ad71f1eb631b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=0$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/a/02ad7944fc173498e585895d1144048fcaeed2eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{\\varphi(7^{z})}{\\varphi(7^{z+1})} = \\tfrac{1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"87\" height=\"29\" />; if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/b/c9b762d600896ea82c99d490b90c0c0d11ee4938.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/a/c6a2478eba950460f69ad4c5c768c474a34f80a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{\\varphi(7^{z})}{\\varphi(7^{z+1})} = \\tfrac{7^{z-1}\\varphi(7)}{7^{z}\\varphi(7)} = \\tfrac{1}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"170\" height=\"30\" />.</li></ul>\n<p>Thus, the sum of all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/a/22a4a58753bfe0a8831beb17bc44ddc5c1136ef3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{\\varphi(a)}{\\varphi(b)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"32\" height=\"29\" /> is<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02ddea5b0f62a1b158c5c54011e3f9b8f20b8ca8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(4+8)(\\tfrac{1}{6}+\\tfrac{1}{9})(4+5)(\\tfrac{1}{6}+\\tfrac{1}{7}) = \\tfrac{65}{7}.\\]\" width=\"268\" height=\"21\" />We extract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/7/107933eaea5be395039765946999face571d3db0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$65+7 = \\boxed{72}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"105\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~Sedro\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017114418\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.077 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 150/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8279/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:33787:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017114418 and revision id 260312. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}